h legendary people as Jacque Fresco, one of the most famous futurists in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/14d05471e18551ebb58a9a54a17c5e81.poster.avif?t=1727716285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/14d05471e18551ebb58a9a54a17c5e81.webm?t=1727716285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/14d05471e18551ebb58a9a54a17c5e81.mp4?t=1727716285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the multifaceted world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From underground facilities to the golden streets of Endeavour, the last city on the planet, your journey will take you across a whole region filled with new challenges, new robots, and mysteries to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/7e57935c286cbf66b6b6e6a95e773042.poster.avif?t=1727716285\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/7e57935c286cbf66b6b6e6a95e773042.webm?t=1727716285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1582850/extras/7e57935c286cbf66b6b6e6a95e773042.mp4?t=1727716285\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
